tent_review":"source_verified"},{"id":"youtube-e7vk4IplJjo","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"video","title":"Lethal Wedding Demo Official Trailer | Wishlist Now on Steam!","summary":"Mega Cat Studios의 공식 영상. 개발사 공지에 연결된 자료이며, 조회수 변화나 유입 효과는 확보하지 않았습니다.","occurred_at":"2026-09-08T16:04:33Z","published_at":"2026-09-08T16:04:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e7vk4IplJjo","verified_at":"2026-10-20T06:59:59Z","discovery_method":"official_announcement_video","content_review":"source_verified","relationship_source_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/games/4624120/announcements/detail/695397189431593330"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1840944183789498","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"Lethal Wedding Live at Pixel Arcadia 2026!","summary":"8월 24일 Pixel Arcadia Showcase 참가와 시청 채널을 안내했다.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T17:39:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/games/4624120/announcements/detail/695395286786248046","verified_at":"2026-10-20T07:01:09Z","discovery_method":"verified_official_steam_news","content_review":"source_verified"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1840310314352171","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"Want to Playtest Lethal Wedding? Playtest Applications Now Open! ","summary":"후원자 우선 비공개 플레이테스트를 모집했다. 비동기 설문 또는 실시간 세션 방식과 NDA 등 참가 조건을 안내했다.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T17:27:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/games/4624120/announcements/detail/679632054236743055","verified_at":"2026-10-20T07:01:09Z","discovery_method":"verified_official_steam_news","content_review":"source_verified"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1839676055898411","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"Pre-Order Store is LIVE & Dev Progress Report","summary":"Hey everyone!We’ve got a double feature for you today: the BackerKit Pre-Order Store is officially open, and we’re dropping a full breakdown of what the team’s been working on behind the scenes! Missed the Campaign? The Pre-Order Store is Now Open!If you have friends who missed out on the live Kickstarter campaign or if you backed a tier earlier and realized you want to grab additional physical loot, then the pre-order store is your chance to get in on the action!Featured Pre-Order Highlights:Bi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T20:42:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055898411","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1836506165568799","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"Cake is Cut, Campaign is Closed! 389% Funded!","summary":"The final bell has rung, the reception doors are closed, and we are standing here completely blown away. The Lethal Wedding Kickstarter campaign is officially over, and you all absolutely crushed it.Saying thank you honestly doesn't feel like enough, but from the bottom of our hearts, a massive, bloody thank you to everyone who backed the project, shared the link, or just cheered us on in the comments. You are the reason this game is coming to life on Sega Genesis/Mega Drive, and Steam.VICTORY I","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T18:36:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165568799","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1836506165565991","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"The Final 24 Hours! We Are 350% Funded!","summary":"The final 24-hour countdown is officially on, and honestly, we are staring at the numbers in absolute shock. Thanks to this incredible community crashing the gates and backing the project, Lethal Wedding is officially 350% funded!We could not have asked for a wilder, more passionate group of backers to bring this Sega Genesis dream to life. A massive, bloody thank you to every single one of you who pledged, shared, and cheered us on. You guys RULE!!!Last Call for Exclusive LootWith the clock tic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T16:56:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165565991","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1836506165563061","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"48 Hours to Go! Inside Devblog #2 and the Race to the Nintendo Switch Goal","summary":"The final 48-hour countdown is officially on, and the reception doors are about to lock!If you’ve been sitting in the back row waiting to make your move, or wanting to snag that newly unlocked Deluxe Physical CD add-on, this is your last chance to crash the party. Once these two days are up, the campaign wraps and these exclusive rewards are locked away for good. Here is what we are looking at for these last two days:🎮 The Next Major Goal: Nintendo Switch Port at $60K!Thanks to you guys complete","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T16:21:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165563061","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1836506165560951","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"$50K Smashed! Deluxe CD Unlocked, More Gore, and Lead Dev Spotlight!","summary":"Hey guys!The final countdown is on! The Kickstarter campaign is hitting a fever pitch, and we’re right there with you. We’ve got a massive update ready for you today including new milestones, updated gameplay footage, and a deep-dive with our lead programmer that pulls the curtain back on how this beast actually runs. Let’s get into it.🥳 We hit $50k! The Deluxe CD Add-On is Unlocked!We just blew past the $50,000 mark, which means the Fatman and Team Fat Deluxe CD Add-on is officially unlocked. M","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-29T20:40:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165560951","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1836506165560724","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"Featured Artists: Gryzor’s ZAMN Homage + Industry Legend Simon Butler Interview!","summary":"Hey backers,We’re down to the final days of the campaign, and it’s the perfect time to highlight some of the talent behind the game. Today, we’re featuring two retro scene veterans who have been lending us a hand. Fresh Retro Terrors from Gryzor!If you backed ZPF, one of our most successful Kickstarter campaigns to date, or played Super XYX, you already know Gryzor’s incredible range as a pixel artist. He has a unique talent for switching styles, going from the heavy, futuristic fantasy-horror o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-29T17:51:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165560724","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1836506165550244","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"Live from the Reception: Joe McDermott & Karl O'Janpa 🎹","summary":"Hey backers,We promised more audio goodies this week, and today we are doubling down with two brand-new music features. If you love 16-bit sound design or just want to see how the soundtrack comes together, grab your headphones.Here is a quick look at what just dropped:Joe McDermott (Team Fat): \"Veil of Fears\" PerformanceFirst up, Team Fat legend Joe McDermott has a standalone performance video jamming through \"Veil of Fears,\" one of the tracks he made specifically for the game.Joe’s process is ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T16:59:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165550244","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1836506165547319","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"Behind the Brush with Bill Tiller! 🎬","summary":"Hey guys!We are back with our next video feature for the week. Today, we're hanging out with LucasArts legend Bill Tiller, the visionary artist behind The Curse of Monkey Island, The Dig, as well as Zombies Ate My Neighbors.Since you all recently smashed through his stretch goal milestone, we wanted to give you a closer look at the man behind the upcoming Kickstarter exclusive alternate box art and physical posters. A few highlights from the video:LucasArts Nostalgia: Bill talks about his histor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T23:23:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165547319","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1835871199316079","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"Behind the Music with The Fatman & Team Fat! 🎬","summary":"Hey everyone,The campaign momentum hasn't slowed down a bit, and as promised, the first of our video features is officially ready for you today.George “The Fatman” Sanger and Joe McDermott of Team Fat, the legendary minds behind the original Zombies Ate My Neighbors soundtrack, sat down to chat about music, retro gaming, and our collaboration.What’s Inside the Video:The Zombies Ate My Neighbors DNA: The guys dive into how they originally captured that iconic, campy horror-comedy vibe in the 90s,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T16:24:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199316079","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1835871199314204","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"300% Funded! Bill Tiller Stretch Goal Smashed + This Week's Lineup!","summary":"Well, you absolute madmen actually did it. Thanks to you, we just blew right past 300% funding! Our first stretch goal didn't even stand a chance before the wedding punch could even get cold. 🔓 Stretch Goal Highlight: $45,000 – Bill Tiller Special Key Art Unlocked! LucasArts legend and adventure game royalty Bill Tiller (The Curse of Monkey Island) is officially bringing his iconic art style to the world of Lethal Wedding! Here is exactly what this milestone unlocks for our community:Exclusive A","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-22T23:17:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199314204","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1835871199305136","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"Devblog #1 is Live! Origins, Art, & Audio Video Feature 🎬","summary":"Hey everyone,You wanted a raw look at how this madness is getting made, so today we’re officially lifting the veil on Devblog #1. Building a brand-new game for the Sega Genesis / Mega Drive means constantly fighting the technical limitations of 1989 hardware while trying to deliver a modern, \"dripping with juice\" gameplay experience. Today, we’re diving deep into how our chaotic story came to be, the optical illusions powering our art team, and how we squeezed absolute cinematic panic out of a 1","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T18:10:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199305136","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1835871199301354","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"New Co-Op Gameplay & Weapons Trailer is Live! 🎬","summary":"Hey everyone,While our team is still arguing over how many wedding puns are legally allowed in Devblog #1, we figured we shouldn't keep you waiting to see some fresh, chaotic action!We just released a brand-new trailer that focuses heavily on what makes Lethal Wedding special: chaotic couch co-op and an arsenal of weapons that make absolutely no sense in a traditional wedding budget.Check out the new trailer below to see Joanna and Shelly working together to turn killer carnies into confetti:Her","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-17T16:34:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199301354","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1835236783560854","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"Stretch Goals & Legendary Collaborations!","summary":"Hey backers,We have officially cruised past over 250% funded! To every single one of you who has backed, shared, and cheered us on: thank you. You’ve proven that the only thing stronger than a mother-in-law's unfiltered opinions is the retro community's love for 16-bit, couch co-op carnage. But the wedding reception is just getting started. It’s time to talk about how we’re going to make this celebration even bigger and badder!STRETCH GOALSYou've proven you can handle the criminal clown syndicat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T15:47:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783560854","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1834602721186166","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"Double the Budget, Double the Carnage: We Hit 200% Funding!","summary":"Hey backers,The wedding fund just doubled. Thanks to your insane momentum, Lethal Wedding has officially blasted past 200% funding! You are giving this bride a massive war chest to take down the clown syndicate, and the whole team at Mega Cat is completely floored by the support.Because you stepped up to back this project so early, the open warfare is hitting a whole new level. To celebrate crossing this massive milestone, our CEO and chief pixel wrangler, James Deighan, wanted to drop a quick m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T23:41:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721186166","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-lethal-wedding-1833968530901581","game_id":"lethal-wedding","kind":"announcement","title":"100% FUNDED! The Wedding is Officially On!","summary":"Hey Backers!HOLY CRAP, we did it!!! Thanks to your incredible support, Lethal Wedding just cleared its funding goal. We are officially 100% funded! IN JUST 90 MINUTES!!This means the game is officially happening. The physical Sega Genesis / Mega Drive cartridges and Kickstarter exclusive rewards are locked in! We set out to make a game that captures the raw, ridiculous energy of late-night B-movies and old-school arcade shooters, and seeing you rally behind it like this means the world to the wh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-02T21:39:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530901581","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[{"game_id":"lethal-wedding","from":"2026-10-20T06:59:21Z","to":"2026-10-20T06:59:21Z","observation":"최초 단일 관측에서 데모 동접 0명이 확인되었습니다. 비교 관측이 없어 변화량·증가 구간·행사 효과는 판단할 수 없습니다. 이 0은 정상 API 응답이며 미확보 값이 아닙니다. 단일 순간값으로 흥행 실패를 판단할 수 없습니다.","hypothesis":null,"alternative_explanations":["시간대와 자연스러운 접속 변동 등 다른 요인의 영향을 분리할 관측 이력이 없습니다."],"evidence_event_ids":["steam-lethal-wedding-1846651706692897"],"evidence_sample_times":["2026-10-20T06:59:21Z"],"assessment":"insufficient","reviewed_at":"2026-10-20T07:07:13Z"}],"news_status":{"lethal-wedding":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:16:09Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:16:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"lethal-wedding":"2026-10-26T03:16:09Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4624120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:16:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:16:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4768410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:16:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:16:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
